          "textHash": "2eaef8c606b145adb829122ecac5d131daa6bc5f71e1f86024894bdec5fd2bc7",
          "spokenText": "Three places in Hah Noy's Old Quarter offer three ways to look at a neighbourhood: a place of worship, a house shaped by trade, and a market. We begin with Bahk Mah Temple, then explore 87 Mah May and Zohng Swun Market. At each stop, choose a question and take a closer look at one detail. These are pages of discovery, not walking directions.",
