          "textHash": "2b8ec05c6f58f8d15109aff9cc23cf33ab43b7d48851acd657088b38fc2ba70e",
          "spokenText": "Look for the connected roof sections and timber structure described by the heritage portal. The temple has been repaired over time, so we do not assign the whole building to a single construction year. Observe only from areas open to visitors and follow guidance at the site.",
